[client.qc] NoExit SP/Coop fix (use "noexit" console variable only in DM)
[client.qc] Respawn velocity fix (prevents player from keeping previous velocity when respawning)
[client.qc] Respawning where player died (prevents player from respawning where player died when all respawn spots are occupied)
[client.qc] Fraglimit/timelimit fix (only use fraglimit/timelimit in DM)
[client.qc] Suicide during intermission fix (should not be able to commit suicide during intermissions)
[client.qc] Swimming up with +jump now as fast as +forward and looking up
[client.qc] DOPA episode ending text
[client.qc] Ghost eyes and hovering bodies fix (fixing client disconnect)
[client.qc] Samelevel fix (recognizing "samelevel" only in DM)
[client.qc] Incorrect frag sentence when a player disconnects fix (frag/frags)
[client.qc] Player drops backpack on suicide (using "Killed()" function on suicide)
[client.qc] Noexit without dying (recognizing "noexit" 3/4)
[combat.qc] Teamplay 1 fix (players can't hurt themselves in teamplay 1 mode)
[combat.qc] Doors no Quad power fix (recognizing doors)
[combat.qc] CanDamage fix (checking half-sized bounding box)
[combat.qc] God cheat preserves armor and prevents underwater gagging (Pentagram still won't)
[demon.qc] Demon death fix (Demon corpse stops being solid after death frame #3 instead of #6)
[doors.qc] Door unlock sound fix (unlock sound overwritten by door opening sound)
[fish.qc] Fish death fix (dying fish block your way much longer and cannot be gibbed)
[items.qc] Thunderbolt fix (don't switch to Thunderbolt in DM when underwater)
[items.qc] Nailgun name fix ("nailgun" --> "Nailgun")
[items.qc] Improved weapon switching (switch to new weapon if it is better, otherwise only if you were using your best weapon and the new one is better)
[misc.qc] Misc_FireBall default speed typo fix (default speed of lavaball accidentally set to zero)
[monsters.qc] Fish count bug
