[plats.qc] Smooth plat movement (make plats move smoother by increasing movement from 10 to 100 fps)
[player.qc] Dead bodies glow/palette shift fix (avoid killed players with Quad/Pentagram from glowing and client from shifting palette till respawn)
[player.qc] Slime hurt fix (no bubbles are spawned when hurt in slime)
[player.qc] Bubbles fix (sometimes bubble spawner entities are not removed; not all bubbles are spawned when player dies)
[player.qc] Walkframe leak fix (.walkframe var, being incremented in player_stand while holding the axe, goes > 6)
[shalrath.qc] Shalrath spawn start function call fix (calling walkmonster_start directly like all other monsters)
[shambler.qc] Fix for Shamblers being non-solid to projectiles after using their lightning attack (s_light.mdl entity conflict)
[triggers.qc] Double/inverted telefrag fix (recognizing time on spawning tdeath)
[triggers.qc] hurt_touch fix (now every player in the entity gets hurt every second)
[weapons.qc] Coop cheats fix (impulse cheats should also be allowed in Coop)
[weapons.qc] Constantly checking all impulses fix (impulse cmds checked every frame w/o any impulse cmd entered)
[weapons.qc] Grenades bounce off skies fix (enhancing grenade touch function)
[weapons.qc] Swinging axe w/o hitting anything won't wake up monsters
[world.qc] Cheats sound fix (precache sounds to enable powerup sounds when cheating in maps w/o those items)
[world.qc] Skill variable not correctly set on worldspawn and can be changed through gameplay (reading cvar "skill" only on worldspawn)

Multiple files:
===============
